[{"id":"1266321345748652037","date":1590749510000,"rawContent":"Keep embarrassing yourselves. Stirring even more anger. Now you\u2019re trying to hide the mess that YOU made. What other press gonna get arrested? You can\u2019t arrest the cops involved, but a black reporter oh no problem. These cops just don\u2019t get it. #BlackLivesMatter #GeorgeFloyd","userId":70289444,"media":null,"username":"Shaikh_Shack","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266326466561794048","date":1590750731000,"rawContent":"They have been doing this to everyone, even those who aren\u2019t protesting. They couldn\u2019t do this to the white people protesting social distancing laws. But protesting the injustice racist killing of a black man oh no problem lets dump all the tear gas and mace #BlackLivesMatter","userId":70289444,"media":null,"username":"Shaikh_Shack","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":2,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266328219072020487","date":1590751149000,"rawContent":"A white dude doing this. But others wanna pin this on black people. Whether this is actually a cop, the distrust is clear. Where were the cops to arrest this guy??? They macing all the innocent people and peaceful protesters. But not this guy #BlackLivesMatter #GeorgeFloyd","userId":70289444,"media":null,"username":"Shaikh_Shack","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate