 more reason to defund and abolish. This is one of those reasons. We do not live in a police\/military state. Where are those people who were defending 2nd Amendment rights. Smh #BlackLivesMatter","userId":70289444,"media":null,"username":"Shaikh_Shack","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":10,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":10.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1270066899389427715","date":1591642520000,"rawContent":"\u201cBlack Lives Matter. The New York Yankees condemn racism, prejudice and injustice in all forms.\u201d Thank you Yankees! Proud to be a fan of this team #Yankees #BlackLivesMatter","userId":70289444,"media":null,"username":"Shaikh_Shack","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":11,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":11.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1270466158953627650","date":1591737711000,"rawContent":"Hold up let me fix this:\n\n\u201cStop treating [black people] like animals and thugs and start treating [black people] with some respect ... Our [cops] abandoned [black people]. The [cops] are vilifying [black people]. It\u2019s disgusting.\u201d\n\n#BlackLivesMatter","userId":70289444,"media":null,"username":"Shaikh_Shack","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":12,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":12.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0}]